frame
------------------------------------------
Frame handles the buildup and synchronization of a set of simultaneous touches.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libX11_6-1.8.13-1
  libXi6-1.8.3-1
  libframe-devel-2.5.0-1bl1
  libframe6-2.5.0-1bl1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  asciidoc-10.2.1-1
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libX11-devel-1.8.13-1
  libXext-devel-1.3.7-1
  libXi-devel-1.8.3-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2
  xorg-server-devel-21.1.25-1
  xorgproto-2025.1-1

Canonical website:
  https://launchpad.net/frame

Canonical download:
  https://launchpad.net/frame/trunk/v2.5.0/+download/frame-2.5.0.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack frame-2.5.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./frame-2.5.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/frame-2.5.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/frame-2.5.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libframe6-2.5.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libframe-devel-2.5.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(frame)
  /usr/bin/frame-test-x11.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/frame.README
  /usr/share/doc/frame/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/frame/COPYING.GPL3
  /usr/share/doc/frame/README
  /usr/share/man/man1/frame-test-x11.1.gz

(libframe6)
  /usr/bin/cygframe-6.dll

(libframe-devel)
  /usr/include/oif/frame.h
  /usr/include/oif/frame_backend.h
  /usr/include/oif/frame_internal.h
  /usr/include/oif/frame_x11.h
  /usr/lib/libframe.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/frame-x11.pc
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/frame.pc

